421 - For All the Saints
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 421
Topic: Doctrines - 

Verse 1:
[Bm]For [C]allthe [D]saints [Em]who [Bm]from [Em/B]their [Am]labors [G]rest,
[F#dim]Who [Em]thee [D]by faith [Em/B]before [Am]the [D]world [D7/C]confessed.
[G]Thy [D/F#]name, O [G]Jesus, [D]be [C]forever [Bm]blest.
[Am]Alleluia!Alleluia!

Verse 2:
[Bm]Thou [D]wast [C]their [D]Rock,
[Bm]their [C]Fortress and [Am]their [G]Might;
[F#dim]Thou, [D]Lord, [Em/B]their [Am]captain
[F#dim]in [D]the [Em/B]well-fought [D7/C]fight;
[G]Thou, [C/E]in [G]the [D]darkness [Em]drear,
[G]their one [D]true [Am]light.
[Am]Alleluia!
[Am]Alleluia!

Verse 3:
[Bm]O [D]may [Bm]Thy [Em/B]soldiers,
[Bm]faithful, true, [Em/B]and [D]bold,
[F#dim]Fight [D]as [G]the [D7/C]saints
[F#dim]who [D]nobly [G]fought [D]of [Em/B]old,
[G]And win [D]with [Am]them
[G]the [C/E]victor's [D]crown [Am]of [Em]gold.
[Am]Alleluia!
[Am]Alleluia!

Verse 4:
[Bm]And [C]when [Em]the [C]strife [Am]is [G]fierce,
[Bm]the [D]warfare long,
[F#dim]Steals [D]on [G]the [D7/C]ear
[F#dim]the [D]distant [Am]triumph [D7/C]song,
[G]And [C/E]hearts [G]are [D]brave [Am]again,
[G]and arms [D]are [Am]strong.
[Am]Alleluia!
[Am]Alleluia!

Verse 5:
[Bm]From [D]earth's [C]wide [D]bounds,
[Bm]from [C]ocean's farthest [G]coast,
[F#dim]Thro' [D]gates [Am]of [D7/C]pearl
[F#dim]streams [D]in [Em/B]the [G]countless [Em/B]host,
[G]Singing to [C]Father,
[G]Son, [D/F#]and [G/B]Holy [Bm]Ghost,
[Am]Alleluia!
[Am]Alleluia!
